laria species (17). The active ingredient and antioxidant compounds can be natural and effective drugs for breast cancer. Using effective medications can be a treatment for cancer, chronic illness and other diseases (18). Laboratory methods to diagnose the disease and then the drug process for treating the disease are a good strategy (19). The effects of drugs, additives and substances are determined in scientific and pharmacological studies (20). © 2017, Pharmainfo Publications. All rights reserved.},
